Subject: [PATCH] Restore DEX thermal complex dispatch on One UI 9

Retain all six current donor types/ordinals and all target thresholds.
Restore DEX as ordinal six and dispatch to a real display-aware thermal
handler using the existing One UI 9 OverheatAppKillType.DEX controller.
Do not skip unsupported XML, swallow Enum errors or disable thermal policy.

--- a/smali/com/sec/android/sdhms/thermal/overheatcontrol/overheatcomplex/OverheatComplexType.smali
