+    sput-object v0, Lcom/sec/android/sdhms/thermal/overheatcontrol/overheatcomplex/OverheatComplexType;->UNICA_DEX:Lcom/sec/android/sdhms/thermal/overheatcontrol/overheatcomplex/OverheatComplexType;
+
     invoke-static {}, Lcom/sec/android/sdhms/thermal/overheatcontrol/overheatcomplex/OverheatComplexType;->a()[Lcom/sec/android/sdhms/thermal/overheatcontrol/overheatcomplex/OverheatComplexType;
 
